in":"EmrysMyrddin","id":3855602,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU2MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3855602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin","html_url":"https://github.com/EmrysMyrddin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T19:20:22Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T19:20:22Z","body":"Humm, 0.3s is like a lot of time for a `realpath` call. It was way less when I tested it, but i'm macOS, so perhaps it doesn't behave exactly the same than Linux.\n\nWhat is your proposition? When do you think would be a better time to check this, at compile or export time ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3463442474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3465304863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112020#issuecomment-3465304863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112020","id":3465304863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OjFsf","user":{"login":"migueldeicaza","id":36863,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza","html_url":"https://github.com/migueldeicaza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/migueldeicaza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T23:56:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T23:56:26Z","body":"It is possible that it depends on how deep the hierarchy goes.\n\nI suspect the reason for this was to catch scenarios where the user was calling open, and to notify the user of this possible challenge, that might be doable as it exists today by providing an intermediate checked_open method that would do this thing when the user is using it.   This particular problem was just made more pronounced with Godot scanning all files and attempting the UID mapping over the network.\n\nThat is one step in the right direction and would be simpler to implement.\n\nBut googling, it looks like this is the source of frustration for people, so that might be another vote to have a dedicated lint/check pass for users to do this.\n\nAlternatively, in this modern era where everyone has to run beta tests, these kinds of errors would be caught by user reports, and the check can be omitted altogether, and the solution documented.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3465304863/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3468135205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112020#issuecomment-3468135205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112020","id":3468135205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ot4sl","user":{"login":"EmrysMyrddin","id":3855602,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU2MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3855602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin","html_url":"https://github.com/EmrysMyrddin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T13:52:58Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T13:52:58Z","body":"Yeah, if it makes a significant overhead on Godot start, I don't find it a useful enough check.\n\nGodot startup time has always been something people really like, let's not degrade it for some rare case issue that you will probably find out by just trying the game once on a non case-insensitive FS (which is by itself already not that common).\n\nWe can perhaps have an option to enable it for people that actually want it?\nI like the lint/check stage idea, but from what I know this is not something that already exists.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3468135205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3468139568","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112020#issuecomment-3468139568","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112020","id":3468139568,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ot5ww","user":{"login":"EmrysMyrddin","id":3855602,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NTU2MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3855602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin","html_url":"https://github.com/EmrysMyrddin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EmrysMyrddin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-30T13:54:00Z","updated_at":"2025-10-30T13:54:00Z","body":"We could also at least check if the FS is in case-insensitive mode, but not sure it would improve things that much since most OS have case-insensitive FS by default (macOS and Windows).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions"